{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_05A620","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Mother Base住得还习惯吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":32,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"太棒了！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"那就好。我还以为像你这样的文化人，会不适应这么粗犷的平台。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"因为这里有信天翁、军舰鸟、燕鸥，还有热带鸟……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"有这么多在法国看不到的海鸟！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"……那就好。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"不过，每天只顾着追鸟也不太好……我也想帮点忙。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"那可太感谢了。不过，该拜托你做什么呢……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"不过，我从来没开过枪……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"Cécile，你在森林里行动的本事是在哪学的？那些鸟完全没在警戒你。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":91,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"与森林融为一体，是<R=观鸟者,BIRDER>的基本功。鸟一旦察觉到人的气息，行为也会发生变化，那样就没法准确观察了。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=观鸟者,BIRDER>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":155,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"原来如此……和侦察兵有相通之处。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"而且我很擅长发现远处的鸟、在自然环境里察觉周围的动静，还能根据细微的痕迹追踪。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"越来越像侦察兵了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"不和鸟保持同样的心境，就找不到鸟。这样看来，我能帮上忙吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"嗯。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":6,"review_flag":""}]}